            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "We are very proud to announce that ISMC's Director, Professor Leif Stenberg has been elected as the Vice-President of EURAMES (Nordic Society for Middle Eastern Studies), an association of national scholarly societies for Middle Eastern studies, which carries out networking and research-related activities. The announcement was made at the WOCMES 2018 conference Seville.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
